lt in north Bengal, limited damage reported in initial accounts.","Cyclone_Recent_Event":"In May 2024, Cyclone Remal (landfall near WB-Bangladesh coast). It included a cyclonic storm, and strong winds and heavy rain, extensive power outage and damage to housing/trees.","Landslide_Recent_Event":null,"Heatwave_Recent_Event":"In May-Jun 2024, a severe heatwave affected large parts of India. It included sustained extreme temperatures (often over 45Â°C in hotspots), and there was a spike in heat-stress/heat-stroke cases, advisories and disruptions, and 2024 was among the more severe recent seasons.","Drought_Recent_Event":null}},{"type":"MultiPolygon","arcs":[[[-16653,-17629,28937,-16663,-17627,28938,-16660,-17625,17623,-17623,28939,-16514,28940,28941,28942,28943,28944,28945,28946,28947,28948,28949,28950,28951,28952,28953,-28019,28954,28955,28956,28957,28958,28959,-28012,28960,28961,28962,28963,28964,28965,28966,28967,28968,28969,28970,28971,28972,28973,28974,28975,28976,28977,28978,28979,28980,28981,28982,28983,28984,28985,-27547,28986]],[[-16657]]],"properties":{"STATE":"West Bengal","DISTRICT":"Uttar Dinajpur","DISTRICT_ID":"19_311","Flood_risk_Category":4,"EarthQuake_risk_Category":4,"Cyclone_risk_Category":1,"LandSlide_risk_Category":1,"HeatWave_risk_Category":3,"Drought_risk_Category":4,"Flood_Recent_Event":"In May 2024, Cyclone Remal-linked flooding and wind damage. It included a severe cyclonic storm, storm surge and heavy rain, and coastal/lowâ€‘lying flooding and widespread power disruption, casualties and property damage reported.","Earthquake_Recent_Event":"In Oct 2023, Sikkim/Teesta valley seismic events and regional tremors. It included himalayan seismicity, and tremors were felt in north Bengal, limited damage reported in initial accounts.","Cyclone_Recent_Event":null,"Landslide_Recent_Event":null,"Heatwave_Recent_Event":null,"Drought_Recent_Event":"In 2016 (and recurring deficits since), a monsoon deficit led to drought-like conditions. It included low ra